@@ -45,9 +53,13 @@ behaviour testable.
 ## Snapshot format
 
 ```json
-{"version": 1, "entries": [{"key": "a", "value": 1, "updated_at": 1700000000.0}]}
+{"version": 1, "entries": [{"key": "a", "value": 1, "updated_at": 1700000000.0,
+                            "expires_at": 1700000060.0}]}
 ```
 
+`expires_at` is absolute and only present for keys with a TTL. Expired keys are
+not written and are dropped on load.
+
